{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-jebo-pond-steriliser-2512-0235","content_id":"3e5be62d-4db1-46b7-aa0a-59b9605cd0ef","description":"Product Safety Report for Jebo Pond Steriliser presenting a high risk of fire and electric shock.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"a14dec0d-82ef-4dec-83f8-ae2bcb9e072c","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-12-23T22:23:12+00:00","id":"a14dec0d-82ef-4dec-83f8-ae2bcb9e072c","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-01-28T12:52:20+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/694b165072075a1d4a508a9a/2512-0235-product-safety-report-pond-steriliser.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Jebo Pond Steriliser</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a high risk of fire and electric shock as it is fitted with a two-pin plug, which is not permitted for sale in the UK.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action:  The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Pet care and pet accessories - Aquarium Aids/Accessories</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Jebo</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>UV-H18</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Ultraviolet aquarium pond steriliser with wall plug and power supply.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_a14dec0d-82ef-4dec-83f8-ae2bcb9e072c\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/694b165072075a1d4a508a9a/2512-0235-product-safety-report-pond-steriliser.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of fire and electric shock as it is fitted with a two-pin plug which is not permitted for sale in the UK. If a consumer plugs the product into a UK socket, they may receive an electric shock and/or the plug may overheat, leading to fire. The product is also not supplied with a valid Declaration of Conformity or the required markings and warnings.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 2016 or the Plugs &amp; Sockets etc. (Safety) Regulations 1994.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2512-0235</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-24T09:37:31Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"entertainment-leisure-products-outdoors","product_measure_type":["destruction-of-the-product","import-rejected-at-border"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-12-24","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-12-24T09:37:31+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-jebo-pond-steriliser-2512-0235","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-jebo-pond-s